[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8042.149, "timestamp": "02:14:02", "text": "或者这些技术方面的事情，因为大多数"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8044.629, "timestamp": "02:14:04", "text": "人不会理解（音乐）这个节目，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8049.03, "timestamp": "02:14:09", "text": "因为它太复杂了。 不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8052.069, "timestamp": "02:14:12", "text": "下次我也会尽量避免像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8058.229, "timestamp": "02:14:18", "text": "今天这样打开屏幕截图。 我觉得我可能泄露了一些[音乐]方面的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8062.229, "timestamp": "02:14:22", "text": "东西，比如一些API方面的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8064.95, "timestamp": "02:14:24", "text": "我的意思是，即使有人用过它，也不会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8067.35, "timestamp": "02:14:27", "text": "发生什么事。 你只能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8070.87, "timestamp": "02:14:30", "text": "访问我的以及"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8074.229, "timestamp": "02:14:34", "text": "YouTube视频的公开信息数据。 你只需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8077.669, "timestamp": "02:14:37", "text": "简单地调用一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8092.709, "timestamp": "02:14:52", "text": "我们确实很了不起。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8095.27, "timestamp": "02:14:55", "text": "嘿，现在已经12点了。那么，我就说到这里吧，我今天就到此为止"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8097.83, "timestamp": "02:14:57", "text": "。"}]